00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:06.250
What makes you happy?

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:09.000
Are you trying to be rich
because you wanna stick it

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.130
to your parents or
everybody else that said

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:12.083
that you couldn't?

