00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:32.340
which is, I promise you
that the second that you

00:04:32.340 --> 00:04:34.990
stop dwelling, stop worrying about shit

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:36.670
that you cannot control,

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:40.610
start realizing that everything
fucked up is your fault,

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:44.347
you actually get ridiculously
happy, not upset.

00:04:44.347 --> 00:04:47.070
(cheering and applauding)
I mean it, I mean it.

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:51.460
Now, just to make sure
there's no confusion,

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:54.720
you're talking to somebody
who was a Jewish guy

00:04:54.720 --> 00:04:56.250
