00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:17.093
And so in that framework, here's my point.

00:05:19.090 --> 00:05:22.090
If there's any confusion
to the following statement,

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:24.610
there's a very significant
chance that you won't go

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:26.370
